---
manual: element.button
lines: [1936, 1939]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $ok = button "OK!"
  $sure = button "Are you sure?"
end
----------- test code
assert_instance_of Shoes::Button, $ok, "button returns a Shoes::Button"
assert_equal "OK!", $ok.text, "written across it is the text it was given"
assert_equal "Are you sure?", $sure.text
assert_same $ok, find_button("OK!").obj, "the returned button is the one in the window"
